    "enUS": {
      "description": "I need a bottle of a certain liquor - Zombie Juice.  Tavernkeep Smitts at the Scarlet Raven Tavern in Darkshire should have some.\n\nAnd please hurry, {name}.  These nights get cold, and I need that drink to put fire in my veins again!",
      "summary": "Speak with Tavernkeep Smitts.",
      "title": "Zombie Juice",
